      "id": "txt_0529",
      "reading_order": 578,
      "section": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99967232739999,
        "t": 346.383516606,
        "r": 382.81971239540053,
        "b": 337.4880847240328
      },
      "content": "To perform the self test, see Figure 5-1 , then proceed as follows:",
      "hyperlink_hint": true,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_575",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_575",
          "title": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails."
        }
      ],
      "page": 62,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0530",
      "reading_order": 579,
      "section": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.5790899774,
        "t": 322.3837769099,
        "r": 504.0448865072993,
        "b": 302.0283575219328
      },
      "content": "Connect the AC power cord to a grounded AC outlet. Verify the charge/line indicator CHARGE illuminates and an alarm beep sounds.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_575",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_575",
          "title": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails."
        }
      ],
      "page": 62,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0531",
      "reading_order": 580,
      "section": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637829996,
        "t": 295.5037019219,
        "r": 342.9516847673001,
        "b": 286.6082700399328
      },
      "content": "Without a cassette installed, turn on the infuser.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_575",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_575",
          "title": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails."
        }
      ],
      "page": 62,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0532",
      "reading_order": 581,
      "section": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57998637829996,
        "t": 280.0238543799,
        "r": 453.78677564739996,
        "b": 271.1284224979328
      },
      "content": "The LCD screen briefly displays the SELF TEST screen (see Figure 5-1) .",
      "hyperlink_hint": true,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_575",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_575",
          "title": "CAUTION: Do not place the infuser in service if the self test fails."
        }
      ],
      "page": 62,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
