        "b": 136.42761488003282
      },
      "content": " Note: The message 'MECHANISM INITIALIZATION IN PROGRESS' may briefly appear prior to the 'CASSETTE TEST IN PROGRESS' message.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_575",
      "parent_section_id": null,
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
